---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import LanguageToggle from "@/components/LanguageToggle.astro";
import BackToTopButton from "@/components/BackToTopButton.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout py-8 sm:py-12">
    <!-- =========================================================
         Hero
    ========================================================== -->
    <section class="border-border border-b pb-10">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Research Journey
          </h1>

          <p
            data-lang="ko"
            class="ko-body text-skin-base/75 mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7"
          >
            공부, 실무, 연구가 이어지는 과정을 기록합니다. 석사과정에서 시작해
            AI Security 연구로 발전하는 흐름을 천천히 남겨갑니다.
          </p>

          <p
            data-lang="en"
            class="text-skin-base/75 mt-4 hidden max-w-2xl text-base leading-7"
          >
            A record of how study, professional experience, and research
            gradually connect. This journey begins with graduate study and
            develops towards research in AI Security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <LanguageToggle />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =========================================================
         Profile
    ========================================================== -->
    <section class="border-border border-b py-10">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr]">
        <div>
          <p
            class="text-accent text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.16em] uppercase"
          >
            Profile
          </p>

          <h2 data-lang="ko" class="ko-ui mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
            반석 · BAN Seok
          </h2>

          <h2 data-lang="en" class="mt-3 hidden text-2xl font-semibold">
            BAN Seok · 반석
          </h2>

          <p class="text-skin-base/60 mt-2 text-sm">
            IT & Security Engineer · M.S. Student
          </p>

          <p
            data-lang="ko"
            class="ko-body text-skin-base/80 mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-7"
          >
            삼성SDS에서 네트워크, 보안, 클라우드 및 SRE 분야의 실무 경험을
            쌓아왔습니다. 현재 국립공주대학교 테크노융합대학원 IT융합
            석사과정에서 AI와 보안의 접점을 공부하고 있습니다.
          </p>

          <p
            data-lang="en"
            class="text-skin-base/80 mt-5 hidden max-w-2xl leading-7"
          >
            I have built my professional career at Samsung SDS across
            networking, security, cloud infrastructure, and SRE. I am currently
            pursuing an M.S. in IT Convergence at Kongju National University,
            with a growing focus on AI Security.
          </p>

          <a
            href="/about"
            class="text-accent mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-medium underline decoration-dashed underline-offset-4"
          >
            About →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Current Focus -->
        <div class="border-border rounded-xl border p-5">
          <p
            class="text-accent text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.16em] uppercase"
          >
            Current Focus
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-6">
            <li>AI Security</li>
            <li>Enterprise / Private AI</li>
            <li>Lightweight Language Models</li>
            <li>Context-Aware Sensitive Information Detection</li>
          </ul>

          <a
            href="/research"
            class="text-accent mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-medium underline decoration-dashed underline-offset-4"
          >
            Research →
          </a>
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =========================================================
         Timeline
    ========================================================== -->
    <section class="py-10">
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <p
            class="text-accent text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.16em] uppercase"
          >
            Timeline
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">2026</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-skin-base/50 text-sm">Master's → Research → Ph.D.?</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-border relative ml-3 border-s pl-8">
        <!-- Graduate Study -->
        <article class="relative pb-10">
          <span
            class="bg-accent absolute top-1.5 -left-[2.25rem] h-3 w-3 rounded-full"
          ></span>

          <p class="text-skin-base/50 text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">
            August 2026
          </p>

          <h3 data-lang="ko" class="ko-ui mt-1 text-lg font-semibold">
            대학원 과정 시작
          </h3>

          <h3 data-lang="en" class="mt-1 hidden text-lg font-semibold">
            Graduate Study Begins
          </h3>

          <p
            data-lang="ko"
            class="ko-body text-skin-base/70 mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6"
          >
            대학원 과정과 함께 수학, Python, 데이터 분석, AI/ML 기초를 다시
            정리하고 연구 주제를 구체화하기 시작합니다.
          </p>

          <p
            data-lang="en"
            class="text-skin-base/70 mt-2 hidden max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6"
          >
            Graduate study begins with a renewed foundation in mathematics,
            Python, data analysis, and AI/ML while gradually shaping potential
            research questions.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
            <span class="border-border rounded-full border px-3 py-1">
              STUDY
            </span>

            <span class="border-border rounded-full border px-3 py-1">
              AI / ML
            </span>

            <span class="border-border rounded-full border px-3 py-1">
              SECURITY
            </span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Research Question -->
        <article class="relative pb-10">
          <span
            class="border-border absolute top-1.5 -left-[2.25rem] h-3 w-3 rounded-full border bg-[var(--background)]"
          ></span>

          <p class="text-skin-base/50 text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">
            Next
          </p>

          <h3 data-lang="ko" class="ko-ui mt-1 text-lg font-semibold">
            연구 질문 구체화
          </h3>

          <h3 data-lang="en" class="mt-1 hidden text-lg font-semibold">
            Research Question
          </h3>

          <p
            data-lang="ko"
            class="ko-body text-skin-base/70 mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6"
          >
            실무에서 얻은 문제의식을 연구 가능한 질문으로 바꾸고, 관련 논문과
            기존 접근법을 검토합니다.
          </p>

          <p
            data-lang="en"
            class="text-skin-base/70 mt-2 hidden max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6"
          >
            Problems encountered in enterprise IT environments are refined into
            researchable questions through literature review and comparison with
            existing approaches.
          </p>
        </article>

        <!-- Experiments -->
        <article class="relative">
          <span
            class="border-border absolute top-1.5 -left-[2.25rem] h-3 w-3 rounded-full border bg-[var(--background)]"
          ></span>

          <p class="text-skin-base/50 text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">
            Later
          </p>

          <h3 data-lang="ko" class="ko-ui mt-1 text-lg font-semibold">
            실험과 논문
          </h3>

          <h3 data-lang="en" class="mt-1 hidden text-lg font-semibold">
            Experiments & Publications
          </h3>

          <p
            data-lang="ko"
            class="ko-body text-skin-base/70 mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6"
          >
            실험, 실패, 수정, 공동연구자의 기여, 코드 변경과 결과를 가능한
            범위에서 시간순으로 남깁니다.
          </p>

          <p
            data-lang="en"
            class="text-skin-base/70 mt-2 hidden max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6"
          >
            Experiments, failed attempts, revisions, contributor roles, code
            changes, and research outcomes will be documented chronologically
            whenever possible.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =========================================================
         Journal Note
    ========================================================== -->
    <section class="border-border border-t py-8">
      <p
        data-lang="ko"
        class="ko-body text-skin-base/55 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6"
      >
        이 사이트는 학업과 연구 과정에서 생긴 기록을 시간순으로 정리하기 위한
        개인 연구 저널입니다.
      </p>

      <p
        data-lang="en"
        class="text-skin-base/55 hidden max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6"
      >
        This site is a personal research journal for documenting the progression
        of study, experimentation, and research over time.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <BackToTopButton />

  <Footer />
</Layout>
